# QA (M0): walking into the hazard pit kills (step 742); every input during
# the 60-frame Dying timer is ignored; the respawn (step 802) puts the player
# back at the player start with a reset camera, so the full testbed route
# played afterwards finishes exactly like testbed_route (731 steps after the
# route starts at step 845 -> 1575). A stale camera would clamp the respawned
# player to its left edge and break the route.
level  = testbed
seed   = 1
source = handwritten
expect = dies_at frames=742..742 deaths=1 complete frames=1575..1575 state=stage_clear
